description:
*Please note due to the urgent requirement we would only consider candidates who can start a new job within 2 weeks once an offer is agreed.*

We are seeking to recruit an experienced Cloud System Engineer/DevOps with Java coding knowledge, having previously worked in the Fintech/Financial Services sector, preferablly also possess good OJK knowledge.

*Key Devliverables*

1. Responsible for the development, maintenance and optimization of business system and related functions, to ensure the high quality, high performance and high reliability of the system;
2. Responsible for team management and coordination, can lead the team to efficiently complete project development, testing, launch and other work;
3. Cooperate with business departments to understand business requirements and formulate corresponding technical solutions, and provide professional technical guidance and support to team members;
4. Lead the team in planning and designing system architecture, participate in requirement analysis, architecture design, technical decision making and detailed design, write core code and continuously optimize the system;
5. Optimize and refactor the existing system, locate and solve the key issues and technical problems in the system;
6. Overcome various challenges and technical difficulties brought by large data volume, high concurrency, high availability and so on;

*Essential Requirements*

1. Degree or above in computer-related majors, work experience of more than 5 years in IT System management.
2. Experience in the architecture of complex distributed systems, familiar with micro-service architecture, and understanding of big data-related technologies;
3. *Solid JAVA foundation *and deep understanding of JVM, IO, multi-threading, concurrency, network, etc;
4. Familiar with the principles of commonly used middleware, including but not limited to: MySQL, Redis, Kafka, Dubbo, Spring, Spring Boot, SpringCloud and so on;
5. Experience in the financial industry is prefered.

*6. Able to use English at a professional level.*

Job Types: Permanent, Full-time

Salary: Rp30,000,000 - Rp50,000,000 per month



Ability to commute/relocate:
* Jakarta: Reliably commute or planning to relocate before starting work (Required)

Application Question(s):
* How soon could you start a new position once offered?

Experience:
* Financial Industry: 3 years (Required)
* IT System: 5 years (Required)
* Java coding/scripting: 3 years (Required)

Language:
* fluent and clear English (Required)

