description:
Working in Accenture Industry X exposes you to cutting\-edge technologies and provides you with various skills and expertise in digital transformation. You will have to:


Implement features, sub\-components \& services according to microservice architecture

* principles, leveraging AWS services where possible;
* Data parsing and processing using Python;
* Test, Troubleshoot, bug fix, deploy.



What you need to succeed:

* Proven experience in Python development (parsing data, processing data);
* AWS services (DynamoDB, API Gateway, Lambda, EC2\);
* Flask, Django, Fast API;
* Unit testing, E2E testing;
* Good communication and moderation know\-how;
* Experience working in Agile teams.
* Experience in NodeJS (good to have)

