description:
Hello everyone,

Ordent is looking for a Junior Back-End Developer!

Ordent is a team with focus on web technologies. For more than 6 years, Ordent has helped more than 45 clients from different industries, such as Government, Non-Governmental Organization, Private Sectors, and many more.

What you will be doing :

- Participate in the entire product lifecycle, focusing on design, coding, testing, and debugging;
- Design, develop, and maintain scalable and high-performance backend services;
- Implement and maintain APIs using gRPC and Protobuf;
- Work with SQL and NoSQL databases to design efficient data structures and queries;
- Optimize application performance, reliability, and security;
- Collaborate with front-end and other cross-functional teams to deliver integrated solutions;
- Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code following best practices;
- Identify, troubleshoot, and resolve technical issues;
- Work in an Agile/Scrum development environment.

You may be fit to this role if you :

- Hold at least a Bachelor’s degree (S1) in Informatics, Computer Science, or related field
- Have minimum 1 year of experience in a related field (Relevant internship experience is also considered)
- Proficient in Golang (Go programming language);
- Experienced with gRPC and Protobuf;
- Proficient in SQL and NoSQL databases;
- Comfortable using Git and Bitbucket for version control;
- Understand the concept of containerization (Docker);
- Have good problem-solving skills and attention to detail;
- Willing to learn new technologies and work in a fast-paced environment.
- Willing to work onsite at the assigned office location
- Willing to be placed and work within a banking environment / banking project;

