description:
At TechBiz Global, we are providing recruitment service to our TOP clients from our portfolio. We are currently seeking a **Solutions Architect** to join one of our clients' teams. If you're looking for an exciting opportunity to grow in a innovative environment, this could be the perfect fit for you.

The role **responsibilities** consist of two primary parts: client facing technical representative of the team and the technical lead for the development team.

This client-facing part requires comfort in deep-dive technical workshops and in board-level sales presentations.

The development leadership should include creation of technical architecture documentation; working with the QA lead to define the test strategy; leading DevOps to define and implement CI/CD pipelines; ensuring that implementations meet non-functional requirements



* Java platform knowledge.
* Experience with Spring, Maven and GitHub;
* Understanding of Service Oriented Architectures (SOA), as well as Micro-Services Architecture;
* Knowledge of JavaScript frameworks, MVC patterns and principles of REST APIs, OpenAPI, Integration Platforms, API Gateway, etc.
* Knowledge of native mobile development is an advantage.
* Ability to quickly understand new architectural frameworks and best practices;
* Professionally worked with Enterprise Integration Patterns and Frameworks;
* Operational knowledge of application servers, databases, load balancers and other infrastructure components required to deploy web applications in a highly available and scalable environment;
* Good communication and presentation skills.
* Experience with designing solutions for financial services (especially banking);
* Experience with server virtualization and containers technology such as Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD.

